p"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["72 BPM, Gong mode pentatonic scale with elegant traditional Chinese harmonic extensions. Calm, spacious, and misty throughout, carrying a gentle ancient oriental warmth. The mood deepens in the mid-section and fades into empty tranquility at the end. Perfect for late-night creation, quiet study, rainy day relaxation, and peaceful meditation. Minimalist ancient Chinese bedroom production texture: warm rice-paper tonal quality, faint residual flute reverb, lingering guqin overtones, subtle wind and rain ambient noise, soft and transparent low-pass mix, highly negative-space arrangement, delivering healing, serene, and timeless oriental atmosphere.\nVocal Details: Vocal Performance\nWarm, ethereal, and gentle oriental female vocal style. Soft half-sung half-whispered delivery, intimate and transparent in the mix, with relaxed elongated phrasing that embodies classic ancient charm. Long, soothing breath control. Layered subtle background harmonies with delicate traditional vocal ornament accents, blended with guzheng reverb and vast landscape spatial delay. Large empty instrumental segments with no vocals, relying entirely on ambient texture to convey emotion, creating a tender and tranquil aura.\nArrangement: Song Structure & Instrumentation\nUltra-minimal traditional Chinese rhythm: slow wooden block beats, soft rain-like delicate drum taps, unrushed and stress-free groove. Warm guqin as the foundational harmonic bed, elegant long-tone bamboo flute, ethereal guzheng arpeggios, sporadic pipa pluck embellishments, with constant subtle wind and rain ambient texture throughout the track.\nIntro: Wind and rain ambience fades in slowly, guqin overtones unfold gently, bamboo flute enters softly with zero rigid rhythm, building vast empty space.\nVerse: Extremely minimal instrumentation, grounded by warm guqin and soft rain percussion, scattered pipa ornaments, relying on lyrical imagery and negative space to shape mood.\nInstrumental Break: Bamboo flute and guzheng take turns delivering melodic phrases, layered with sustained spatial reverb to paint misty landscape imagery, with persistent wind ambience.\nBridge: All rhythmic elements drop out, leaving only rain, wind texture and floating detuned guqin tones in pure blank serenity, before the gentle beat eases back in.\nOutro: All instrumental layers fade out one by one, ending solely with lingering wind ambience and a final decaying guqin overtone for an empty, peaceful finish."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [3], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Full English Lyrics\n[Intro]\nMmm...\n(rain upon the eaves)\nOoh...\nMmm...\n[Verse]\nNight descends on paper, ink settles soft and low\nEvening wind drifts cloud shades past pavilions slow\nI lay a quiet longing, every stroke in calm repose\nMountains melt in soft frames, mist rises, falls, and flows\nI wait for stars descending, no hurry, no haste, no woe\nWithin this painted dwelling, all worldly beauties show\nHazy tinted visions untouched by mortal smoke\nPeace resides in time, my heart aligns and floats\n[Instrumental]\n[Verse]\nFrame by frame the clouds rise, peaceful every passing day\nGreen hills stretch endless, wandering with twilight’s sway\nI hold the brush to paint the world, unrushed along the way\nScenes of mortal living clear within my gentle gaze\nOne thought births all creation, misty rains are worth the stay\nHalf unrolled landscape waits for wind and moon to play\nI keep this pure tranquility through every passing day\nStroke after stroke I weave, all nature finds its way\n[Chorus]\nMmm... paint the starlight’s glowing haze\n(take your time, let the moments stay)\nOoh... when morning comes, the scenery finds its grace\n(frame by frame, heart in every trace)\n[Instrumental]\n[Bridge]\nSoft rain paints ripples on the window pane...\nBrush and ink compose life’s quiet refrain...\nWind drifts slow, time flows endless and untamed...\n[Chorus]\nMmm... paint the starlight’s glowing haze\n(take your time, let the moments stay)\nOoh... when morning comes, the scenery finds its grace\n(frame by frame, heart in every trace)\n[Instrumental]\n[Outro]\nMmm...\n(brush still lingers on)\nOoh... peaceful night, calm dawn"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [400, 0], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [15], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [387.00006103515625, 94.99998474121094], "pos": [0, 706.6500244140625], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-Music-3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_music3_di